% Bibliography for BFA.jl
%
% Every `bib_key` in `data-raw/{literature_sboxes.toml, apn_catalog/*.toml}`
% must resolve to an entry below; the build script verifies this.
%
% Parsed both by src/data/bibliography.jl's minimal BibTeX parser and, for the
% documentation site, by DocumenterCitations / BibParser. Keep entries standard:
%   - one entry block per record (an entry type, a key, then field = value pairs)
%   - field values must be either brace- or quote-delimited
%     (nested braces inside a value are tracked correctly)
%   - line-leading percent-sign comments are skipped
%   - field concatenation with the hash sign is NOT supported
%   - do NOT put an at-sign followed by a word in a comment: standards-compliant
%     parsers read it as the start of an entry

